Feature: Sales Order

#Scenario: Create Sales Order
#    Given we visit "orders/salesOrder"
#        and we click "Show/hide Form" button
#        and we select "SUSEN TRD" in "customers_id" autocomplete
#      and we enter "2025-05-12" in "date_purchased"
#        and we select "ERP MAIN GODOWN" in "frmVenueId"
#        and we enter "0" in "cartage"
#        and we fill the grid with:
#            | Products                                                         | Rate  | Qty | Disc.% | Disc. Amt. | Stax %| Stax Amt | Amount | Remarks | DI |
#            | JS011BLACK -  JS 011 Black - 1PCS - 14978                        | 5250  | 1   |  0     | 0          | 0     | 0        | 5250   |         |    |
#            | ECOTRAVELLUGGAGE20BLACK -  ECO TRAVEL LUGGAGE 20 - 1PCS - 16943  | 20000 | 1   |  0     | 0          | 0     | 0        | 20000  |         |    |
#    When we click "Save" button
#    Then we should see success message
#    and we should see this entry in grid:
#        | customers_id  | currency_value |
#        | SUSEN TRD     | 25250          |

Scenario: Edit Sales Order
    Given we visit "orders/salesOrder"
       When we clear the from date and search
       when we edit the top row
     #  then we should see "SUSEN TRD" in "customers_id" autocomplete
       then we should see "2025-04-30" in "date_purchased"
#      then we should see "ERP MAIN GODOWN" in "frmVenueId"
       then we should see "SusenZamzama" in "venueId"
       then we should see "39159" in "usps_track_num2"
       then we should see "150" in "cartage"
       then we should see the following in grid:
            | Products                                              | Rate  | Qty | Disc.% | Disc. Amt. | Stax %| Stax Amt | Amount | Remarks | DI |
            | CRYSTAL10BLACK38 CRYSTAL 10 Black / 38 - 1PCS - 58698 | 3000  | 1   |  0     | 0          | 0     | 0        | 3000   |         |    |


